gacy Attainments based on Befouled Rotes and they risk Paradox as if they were Befouled Spells.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-08T09:19:37-07:00","id":1447944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1447826-2e-legacy-homebrew-the-unique-collector-an-abyssal-legacy?p=1447912#post1447912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What does &quot;Befouled Attainments&quot; mean?</div> </div> </div> </div>The term &quot;Befouled Attainment&quot; is only used once in a Legacy sidebar, but the thing it's describing can be found in the last paragraph of the &quot;Autarchs and Shedim&quot; section, straddling pages 96 and 97.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions"